{"version":1,"content":"<p>法國周末騷亂期間多間商店遭破壞和劫掠，網上隨後出現大批疑為放售賊贓的帖文。</p><p>數碼部長勒埃南夫（Anne Le Hénanff）周一（19日）敦促二手交易平台即時下架相關「盜竊物品」，並召集包括Vinted及eBay等平台代表開會談判。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.208846+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T06:12:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T00:37:36.875059+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684287+00:00","content_hash":"e6f66b1ca9b319e75a12d04cf1aa64bc217ed58bc71de8472940365265afa4bb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}